{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/161259-w20-character-generator-plus-fomori-and-spirit-generator","id":161259,"title":"W20 Character Generator Plus Fomori and Spirit Generator","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-06-06T16:55:43-07:00","id":161259,"title":"W20 Character Generator Plus Fomori and Spirit Generator","content":"Edit: 22/07/2020 Long time after my post. Pandemic made me play around old chargens, Since I like to do some of those for fun, in many systems.<br /> <br /> I added some information from rage across the world (two new backgrounds) and for the fomori-spirit generator... well... quite an overhaul. I used all the spirits, banes, elementals, gaia spirits, weaver spirits and wyld spirits in the core book, the book of the wyrm and umbra the velvet shadow. Beside being able to create your spirit you can have the information for every spirit that was pre-generated in these books. With description of the spirits and of all their powers. I did the same for the 10 pre-generated fomori in the book of the wyrm. I have updated the links below.<br /> I just saw that someone asked me for kinfolk and fera... First, let me say, I'm sorry for not answering. a three months after my original post my daughter was born, I moved across states and I was in the middle of my PhD. Second... I might work on kinfolk... but Fera... I would have to do one for each fera, they all have specific character creation things... I don't now... maybe there is a way to make them all into one Fera Chargen... For now... too much trouble for me.<br /> <br /> Well, enjoy.<br /> <br /> I'm not sure if the guys from onyx path have a problem with this kind of CharGen, if that's the case I'll stop sharing and use it only with my group.<br /> <br /> Anyway... I made a CharGen with printable sheet (with dots and all) where the information is automatically sent to the sheet.<br /> <br /> There are description for every gift, rite and fetish.<br /> <br /> I also made a fomori-Spirit generator... you can create your own or click on the list of the spirits presented in the book to have their stats shown.<br /> <br /> Hope it helps<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1_G7clqOU2b0mF8-3d2p7RYkDczv_EDdh/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1_G7clqOU2b0mF8-3d2p7RYkDczv_EDdh/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1_G7clqOU2b0mF8-3d2p7RYkDczv_EDdh/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> https://drive.google.com/file/d/1_G7clqOU2b0mF8-3d2p7RYkDczv_EDdh/view?usp=sharing </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1w2xL4By-Ucbyy7yM65K-Ry3JoBFT5XKi/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1w2xL4By-Ucbyy7yM65K-Ry3JoBFT5XKi/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1w2xL4By-Ucbyy7yM65K-Ry3JoBFT5XKi/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> https://drive.google.com/file/d/1w2xL4By-Ucbyy7yM65K-Ry3JoBFT5XKi/view?usp=sharing </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> First post here. If you guys have any suggestions on how to work on the CharGens or how to post them I'm all ears<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3223,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3223-telles","user":"Telles","date":".  Complete overhaul, after 6 years, hehehe. Mainly in the spirit-bane-fomori generator. 07-22-2020, 07:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3223-telles","name":"Telles","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-06T18:13:29-07:00","id":161295,"title":"","content":"this looks Awesome! thanks for sharing!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/31/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><a href=\"http://glyphery.webs.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ut0SZ4h.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1332-darling_rose","name":"Darling_Rose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1332_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-07T06:27:35-07:00","id":161614,"title":"","content":"You're welcome. Glad you liked it. Don't be afraid to ask for this or that